/draft_*_folder/

# External study assets: retain source attribution; exclude extracted references.
ArtSource/sephiria_style_study_2026-09-16/sephiria_extract/
ArtSource/sephiria_style_study_2026-09-16/refs/

# External reference repos (read-only study material; keep only the README tracked)
/Reference/*
!/Reference/README.md

# Local pixel-tool comparison dependencies
